---
import Link from "./ui/link.astro";
---

<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-sky-700 p-8 md:px-20 md:py-20 mt-20 mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-3xl flex flex-col items-center text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-sky-900/20 group">
  <!-- Decorative circles -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-sky-400 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-3xl opacity-20 translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2"></div>
  
  <div class="relative z-10">
    <h2 class="text-white text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight mb-6">
      Siap untuk <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-200 to-blue-100">Menyelamatkan Bumi?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sky-100 mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Bergabunglah dengan ribuan pengguna lain yang telah berkontribusi nyata. Download sekarang, dan jual sampah daur ulangmu!
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <Link href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.kepul.id&hl=id" style="inverted" class="bg-white text-primary hover:bg-sky-50 border-none shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-full">
        Download App Sekarang
      </Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
